    "detailed_description": "Really Bad Flying Machine is a challenging puzzle game.<br><br>You play as a flying machine that was assembled in a factory but was disposed of because of a defect.<br>You use your abnormal features to find your way back up.<br><br>Find and collect keys to activate elevators. Shoot your own propellers off to break boxes and open paths.<br>Look for secrets in hidden paths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong><br>Each puzzle contains 1 key. Shoot your propellers to break boxes.<br>Once you shoot a propeller, you lose the ability to move to that direction.<br></li><li> <strong>Hidden Secrets:</strong><br>There are gold keys placed in some areas of the game.<br>There are also secrets that you can find and reveal parts of the story.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Really Bad Flying Machine is a challenging puzzle game.<br><br>You play as a flying machine that was assembled in a factory but was disposed of because of a defect.<br>You use your abnormal features to find your way back up.<br><br>Find and collect keys to activate elevators. Shoot your own propellers off to break boxes and open paths.<br>Look for secrets in hidden paths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong><br>Each puzzle contains 1 key. Shoot your propellers to break boxes.<br>Once you shoot a propeller, you lose the ability to move to that direction.<br></li><li> <strong>Hidden Secrets:</strong><br>There are gold keys placed in some areas of the game.<br>There are also secrets that you can find and reveal parts of the story.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a puzzle game where you play as a flying machine. Shoot your propellers off to break boxes. Once you shoot a propeller, you lose the ability to move to its direction. Collect keys to advance through the floors.",
